## API reference

### OrderTracker

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `number:` | `String` | - | Required. Shown as "Order #10482". |
| `items:` / `total:` / `currency:` | `Integer` / `Numeric` / `String` | - / - / `"USD"` | The "2 items · $148.00" line. |
| `status:` | see above | `:processing` | Badge text and color. |
| `progress:` | `Numeric` (0-100) | - | Delivery progress bar; omit to hide it. |

### Parts

| Part | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `OrderTimeline` | The ordered list of steps. |
| `OrderStep(title:, at:, state:)` | A step: a symbol title is translated, `at:` a Time. |
| `OrderCourier(name:, avatar:, stops:, href:)` | Under a separator: the courier, stops left and a link to the map. |

## Accessibility

- The timeline is a labelled ordered list; the current step carries `aria-current="step"`; times are `<time datetime>`.
- The progress bar is labelled "Delivery progress"; the icon-only map button is labelled "Track on map".
